@startuml runtime-deployment
title Runtime - Despliegue
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Equipo del jugador" as machine {
  node "Proceso runtime" as process {
    component "engine.exe" as exe
    component "raylib / SDL2" as libs
    component "DLLs del toolchain" as toolchain
  }
  folder "Directorio de ejecucion" as data {
    folder "levels/" as levels
    folder "assets/" as assets
  }
}

actor "Jugador" as player
player --> exe : inicia y envia input
exe --> libs : ventana, input, audio y render
exe --> toolchain : dependencias nativas
exe --> levels : lee JSON
exe --> assets : lee texturas y sonidos

note bottom of data
El directorio de trabajo se fija a la carpeta
del ejecutable al iniciar main.cpp.
end note
@enduml